{"id":"caul","name":"Caul","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:caul"],"groups":["1. Probably the upper lobe of the liver"],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Caul","text":"(Heb. yothe’reth; i.e., “something redundant”), the membrane which covers the upper part of the liver (Ex. 29:13, 22; Lev. 3:4, 10, 15; 4:9; 7:4; marg., “midriff”). In Hos. 13:8 (Heb. seghor; i.e., “an enclosure”) the pericardium, or parts about the heart, is meant."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H3508","lemma":"יֹתֶרֶת","xlit":"yôthereth","gloss":"the lobe or flap of the liver","kjv":"caul","count":11,"share":0.92},{"strong":"H3516","lemma":"כָּבֵד","xlit":"kâbêd","gloss":"the liver","kjv":"liver","count":11,"share":0.92},{"strong":"H3629","lemma":"כִּלְיָה","xlit":"kilyâh","gloss":"a kidney","kjv":"kidneys, reins","count":11,"share":0.92},{"strong":"H2459","lemma":"חֶלֶב","xlit":"cheleb","gloss":"fat, whether literally or figuratively","kjv":"best, fat, finest, grease","count":11,"share":0.92},{"strong":"H3689","lemma":"כֶּסֶל","xlit":"keçel","gloss":"fatness","kjv":"confidence, flank, folly, hope","count":5,"share":0.42},{"strong":"H5493","lemma":"סוּר","xlit":"çûwr","gloss":"to turn off","kjv":"be, bring, call back, decline","count":6,"share":0.5}],"verses":["Exod.29.13","Exod.29.22","Lev.3.4","Lev.3.10","Lev.3.15","Lev.4.9","Lev.7.4","Lev.8.16","Lev.8.25","Lev.9.10","Lev.9.19","Isa.3.18"],"related":[{"id":"kidney","type":"cooccur","shared":6,"jaccard":0.375,"why":"6 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"fat","type":"cooccur","shared":9,"jaccard":0.237,"why":"9 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"peace-offerings","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.038,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"fat","type":"lexical","strong":"H3508","why":"both lead with יֹתֶרֶת (H3508)"},{"id":"kidney","type":"lexical","strong":"H3508","why":"both lead with יֹתֶרֶת (H3508)"}],"works":[{"work":"callaway","title":"The Religious System of the Amazulu","count":4,"chapters":[{"chapte